   "title": "Part (i)",
   "text": "**Review Q8 (i) log (x y z⁶)**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&\\log (xyz^{6})\\\\[5pt]&=\\log x+\\log y+\\log z^{6}\\quad \\text{[product law]}\\\\[5pt]&=\\log x+\\log y+6\\log z\\quad \\text{[power law]}\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
