    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "title": "Part (ii)",
   "text": "**Review Q8 (ii) log₃ ⁶√(m⁵n³)**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&\\log_{3} ^{6}\\sqrt{m^{5}n^{3}}\\\\[5pt]&=\\log_{3} (m^{5}n^{3})^{\\frac{1}{6}}\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{[6th root = power 1/6]}\\\\[5pt]&=(\\frac{1}{6})\\log_{3} (m^{5}n^{3})\\quad \\text{[power law]}\\\\[5pt]&=(\\frac{1}{6})[\\log_{3} m^{5}+\\log_{3} n^{3}]\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{[product law]}\\\\[5pt]&=(\\frac{1}{6})[5\\log_{3} m+3\\log_{3} n]\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{[power law]}\\\\[5pt]&=(\\frac{5}{6})\\log_{3} m+(\\frac{1}{2})\\log_{3} n\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "cur": 1
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Part (iii)",
   "text": "**Review Q8 (iii) log √(8x³)**  \\[\\begin{aligned}&\\log \\sqrt{8x^{3}}\\\\[5pt]&=\\log (8x^{3})^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\\\[5pt]&=(\\frac{1}{2})\\log (8x^{3})\\\\[5pt]&=(\\frac{1}{2})[\\log 8+\\log x^{3}]\\\\[5pt]&=(\\frac{1}{2})\\log 8+(\\frac{1}{2})(3\\log x)\\\\[5pt]&=(\\frac{1}{2})\\log 2^{3}+(\\frac{3}{2})\\log x\\\\[5pt]&=(\\frac{3}{2})\\log 2+(\\frac{3}{2})\\log x\\end{aligned}\\]",
